OL,3,AAriana Grande makes emotional tour exit
OL,4,Aand steps back from public life
OL,5,
OL,6,FAriana Grande made an emotional exit on
OL,7,FTuesday night, as she wrapped up her
OL,8,FEternal Sunshine tour, and prepared to
OL,9,Fstep back from public life.
OL,11,FThe singer was occasionally close to
OL,12,Ftears - most notably during One Last
OL,13,FTime, the song that took on extra
OL,14,Fmeaning as an anthem for survivors of
OL,15,Fthe 2017 Manchester terror attack.
OL,17,F"London, I'm going to need you to help
OL,18,Fme on this one," she said, kneeling
OL,19,Fdown to be near the audience throughout
OL,20,Fthe performance.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/18
